; Where to look for the @hyperloop-upv scope. Needed so that `pnpm publish`
; targets GitHub Packages instead of npmjs.com.
;
; Deliberately no auth token line here: every @hyperloop-upv/* dependency in
; this monorepo is a workspace link, so pnpm never contacts the registry and
; nobody needs a token to install. Adding _authToken=${NODE_AUTH_TOKEN} would
; make `pnpm install` fail for anyone without that variable set.
;
; That holds only while no @hyperloop-upv/* dependency here comes from the
; registry. If one ever does, auth becomes mandatory for all contributors.
@hyperloop-upv:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
